# Frontend kabinetlar

Stack: React 19, Vite, Tailwind 4, react-router-dom, framer-motion, lucide.

## Majburiy

```ts
// src/shared/config.ts
export const API_URL = 'https://api.milliycrm.uz/api/v1'
```

`api.ts` faqat `import { API_URL } from './config'` — env orqali emas.

## Token kalitlari

- admin → `mydiller_admin_token`
- kurator → `mydiller_kurator_token`
- zavod → `mydiller_ishlabchiqaruvchi_token`
- xaridor → `mydiller_xaridor_token`
- dostavka → `mydiller_dostavka_token`

## Patterns

- Modul: `src/modules/<feature>/`, shell: `src/app/AppShell.tsx`
- Xatolik: `ApiRequestError` + Snackbar; FormData da `Content-Type` qo‘yilmasin
- Mahsulot update/create: `moq`, `payment_term`, `payment_days`, `specs` majburiy (backend validate)
- PDF: `.../contract.pdf`, `.../invoice.pdf` (na `contract-pdf`)
- `limit` query ≤ 100 (backend chegara)

## Admin vs kurator

- `admin`: `/admin/buyurtmalar` faqat `general` (backend `RequireRole`)
- `admin-kurator`: `/kurator/buyurtmalar`, force-majeure, hujjatlar
